nsion\n                  (Lean.MapDeclarationExtension.toPersistentEnvExtension ext))) →\n            optParam.{1} Lean.OLeanLevel Lean.OLeanLevel.exported → Option.{0} α","unsafe":false,"value":174,"source":{"code":"def find? [Inhabited α] (ext : MapDeclarationExtension α) (env : Environment) (declName : Name)\n    (asyncMode := ext.toEnvExtension.asyncMode) (level := OLeanLevel.exported) : Option α :=\n  match env.getModuleIdxFor? declName with\n  | some modIdx =>\n    match (ext.getModuleEntries (level := level) env modIdx).binSearch (declName, default) (fun a b => Name.quickLt a.1 b.1) with\n    | some e => some e.2\n    | none   => none\n  | none => (ext.getState (asyncMode := asyncMode) (asyncDecl := declName) env).find? declName","start":155,"end":162},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}